    {
      "id": "blooming-desire",
      "slug": "blooming-desire",
      "title": "Blooming Desire",
      "dimensions": "24 × 36 in.",
      "medium": "Mixed-media acrylic with organic plaster on canvas",
      "description": [
        "Blooming Desire explores the excitement of finding someone who makes the ordinary feel unfamiliar again, opening a world of experiences to discover together. Cream-colored sculpted flowers rise from intertwining currents of coral, red, and gold, while dark stems and leaves thread through the restless surface.",
        "Each blossom has its own irregular shape, bringing the painting’s idea of imperfect connection into physical form. The swirling textures echo the exchange of thoughts, feelings, and possibilities that accompanies a new relationship. There is pleasure in the uncertainty of what might emerge, and in making the attempt together. At its heart is a desire to be understood and embraced as we are, with room for something shared to grow."
      ],
      "copyStatus": "artist-source",
      "availability": "provisional",
      "availabilityNote": "Availability to be confirmed",
