    {
      "id": "wild-tiger-lilies",
      "slug": "wild-tiger-lilies",
      "title": "Wild Tiger Lilies",
      "dimensions": "24 × 36 in.",
      "medium": "Mixed-media acrylic with organic plaster on canvas",
      "description": [
        "Bright orange tiger lilies punctuate a dense field of curling textures, their spotted petals unfolding among sculpted leaves. A sweeping gold-toned curve leads through greens, pinks, and shadowed passages, offering glimpses of flowers within the intricate surface.",
        "Wild Tiger Lilies draws on the pleasure of discovering beauty beyond familiar paths and carefully tended gardens. Its blooms appear within the surrounding tangle, giving the composition the spontaneity of something encountered while wandering. Their vivid color catches our attention first; the quieter details hold it. The painting celebrates discoveries we could not have planned, and the curiosity that allows us to notice them."
      ],
      "copyStatus": "artist-source",
      "availability": "provisional",
